    "summary": "Blanket; made of cotton. Weft-faced. Woven in nine wide strips, loosely hand tacked together. Natural-coloured cotton warp. Weft-faced bands in black, white, red-, turquoise-, orange-, green-dyed cotton aligned across warp strips. Supplementary weft float bands in white, black, orange-, red- and turquoise-dyed cotton with short tufts inserted along these bands in different colours. Twisted two-tone tassels from weft floats in black weft bands. Loose natural warp thread fringes.",
